<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">SmartThinker: Progressive Chain-of-Thought Length Calibration 
<br class="ltx_break">for Efficient Large Language Model Reasoning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
